{"id":"00073","root":"uni00073_1","name":{"ja":"ラスタ","en":"Luster"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ラスタ","en":"Luster"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-11-02","limited":false,"characterId":60,"profile":{"ja":"ある魔族の細胞を体内に埋め込む人体実験の結果、唯一生き残った半人半魔。確証が得られないままでの実験だったため、生き残りはしたが成功とは言い難く、腕輪によって制御しなければ、破壊衝動に飲まれてしまう。ラスタは元軍人であるが、魔族の強襲により所属部隊の大部分が死亡してしまう。生き残った者も非合法の実験の中で死亡し、ラスタのみが生き残る。ラスタは部隊と自分を死に際まで追い込んだ魔族が許せないが、自分の中にそれが入っている事も許せず、そんな非道な実験をした施設をすべて破壊した。そして力を使い制御ができなくなったところを、別の機関に拘束され匿われた。ラスタは魔族の細胞を分離、制御してもらい、機関はラスタの管理とデータ採取することで関係性が成立している。魔族の力を使い、空中に透明の刃を作りだし、それを自在に操る事ができる。魔族の力を解放すれば身体能力が大幅に強化されるが、能力を使いすぎると自我を保てず、破壊の限りを尽くしてしまう。","en":"Luster is the sole surviving half-human, half-demon from a human experiment that implanted a demon's cells into her body. The experiment never yielded conclusive results, so while she survived, it's hard to call it a success; without the controlling bracelet she would be consumed by a destructive impulse. Luster was a former soldier, but most of her unit perished in a demon assault. The few survivors died in illegal experiments, leaving only Luster alive. She can't forgive the demons that drove her unit to death, nor the fact that she now carries their cells, and she destroyed every facility that performed such cruel experiments. After losing control of her power, another organization captured and sheltered her. She now has her demon cells isolated and controlled by that agency, which in turn manages her and harvests data. Using demon power, she creates transparent blades in the air and manipulates them at will. When she releases more demon power, her physical abilities surge dramatically, but overuse threatens her sanity, turning her into a mindless destroyer."},"illustrator":"新堂エル","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00073_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[946,1892],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[140,280],"def":[119,238],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36